{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7e3c1a2-4f5d-4e8a-9c1b-shoppinglistapi-pretest",
    "name": "ShoppinglistApi — Pre-test Tesis",
    "description": "Coleccion completa para la API Laravel 7 (ammannbe/ShoppinglistApi) usada como pre-test de tesis.\n\nIMPORTANTE — rastrillos del repo original:\n1. La password del registro NO sirve para login: el email de verificacion (VerifyEmail.php:21) REESCRIBE tu password con Str::random(10) y la envia por correo. Con MAIL_MAILER=log, leela del log.\n2. Las rutas de negocio exigen email verificado (middleware 'verified'). Hay que setear email_verified_at en la DB.\n3. POST items exige 'done' y 'creator_email' siempre.\n\nVariables de entorno: baseUrl (default http://localhost:8090/api), token (se setea tras Login), listId, itemId.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8090/api" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "listId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "itemId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "email", "value": "tesis@example.com" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "password123" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Teapot (sin auth, 418)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/im-a-teapot", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["im-a-teapot"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar usuario",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "// La password real llega por email (bug del repo). Leela del log:",
                  "// docker compose -f docker/docker-compose.local.yml exec -T app bash -c \"grep -oE 'Your password is: [A-Za-z0-9]{10}' storage/logs/laravel.log | tail -1\"",
                  "console.log('Recuerda: marcar email_verified_at y usar la password del email.');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Tesis User\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "register"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (obtener token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.token); console.log('Token guardado.'); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"device_name\": \"postman\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/token", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "token"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cerrar sesion (borrar token)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/token", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "token"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Recuperar password (email)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/password/email", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "password", "email"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"newpassword123\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"newpassword123\",\n  \"token\": \"TOKEN_DEL_EMAIL\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/password/reset", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "password", "reset"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Usuario",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Ver perfil",
